{"title": "Fungal Bamboozler", "pageid": 13768, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fungal_Bamboozler", "categories": ["Grenades", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Faded.png/300px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/6/61/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Fungal Bamboozler image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Faded.png/300px-GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/GRN_Noxious_Spore_Grenade_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Fungal Bamboozler</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumable</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Grenades\" title=\"Grenades\">Grenade</a>) item which can be <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">thrown</a> to disperse <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(cloud)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/38px-Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/50px-Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Timmask Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Timmask_Spores_cloud_Icon.webp\"